471
00:33:19.738 --> 00:33:24.738
A woman or a man may not divorce her husband or her wife.

472
00:33:24.738 --> 00:33:28.738
In other words, it points to the person...

473
00:33:28.738 --> 00:33:30.738
who lays down the initiative here...

474
00:33:30.738 --> 00:33:35.738
and initiates the act of breaking the contract.

475
00:33:35.738 --> 00:33:40.738
If I send Vanessa away...

476
00:33:40.738 --> 00:33:42.738
I may not remarry.

477
00:33:42.738 --> 00:33:44.738
Why? Listen carefully.

478
00:33:44.738 --> 00:33:47.738
God is not interested in certificates.

479
00:33:47.738 --> 00:33:50.738
God is not interested in a ceremony.

480
00:33:50.738 --> 00:33:54.738
God is not interested in wedding rings of yellow gold or white gold.

481
00:33:54.738 --> 00:33:57.738
God is interested in people, hearts, and minds...

482
00:33:57.738 --> 00:34:00.738
who serve each other and ultimately come to God.

483
00:34:00.738 --> 00:34:03.738
In that, God is interested.

484
00:34:03.738 --> 00:34:05.738
And God says to Tim...

485
00:34:05.738 --> 00:34:08.738
Are you sure you will take care of Vanessa?

486
00:34:08.738 --> 00:34:10.738
This is my daughter, says the Father.

487
00:34:10.738 --> 00:34:12.738
Are you sure you will serve her?

488
00:34:12.738 --> 00:34:14.738
She already has a relationship with me.

489
00:34:14.738 --> 00:34:17.738
What are you going to do, Tim? Are you going to make her life better?

490
00:34:17.738 --> 00:34:19.738
Or are you going to ruin her life?

491
00:34:19.738 --> 00:34:22.738
This is what the Father says to me.

492
00:34:24.738 --> 00:34:28.738
And in the days of Jesus, the Pharisees came to Jesus and said...

493
00:34:28.738 --> 00:34:35.738
Jesus, Jesus, in the law of Moses there is something about a certificate.

494
00:34:35.738 --> 00:34:39.738
And Jesus says, you do not understand.

495
00:34:39.738 --> 00:34:42.738
The certificate was written in the time of the law...

496
00:34:42.738 --> 00:34:47.738
but it actually had more to do with the arrogance and brokenness of the people...

497
00:34:47.738 --> 00:34:53.738
than that God has any interest in a piece of paper, a signature.

498
00:34:53.738 --> 00:34:55.738
God is not interested in that.

499
00:34:55.738 --> 00:34:58.738
He is interested in whole lives.

500
00:34:58.738 --> 00:35:00.738
Lives that are being built.

501
00:35:00.738 --> 00:35:02.738
Lives that are intact.

502
00:35:02.738 --> 00:35:05.738
Jesus has come to bring life.

503
00:35:05.738 --> 00:35:07.738
Life in all its abundance.

504
00:35:07.738 --> 00:35:11.738
And when I say, God, I am going to participate in this life in all its abundance...

505
00:35:11.738 --> 00:35:16.738
and I promise you that I will serve Vanessa...

506
00:35:16.738 --> 00:35:19.738
so that she can remain the best Vanessa she has always been.

507
00:35:19.738 --> 00:35:21.738
It is well with her soul.

508
00:35:21.738 --> 00:35:24.738
And when I then say, Vanessa, you are a trash.

509
00:35:24.738 --> 00:35:26.738
You can go.

510
00:35:26.738 --> 00:35:30.738
Do you know what God then says? Tim, you might as well not get married anymore.

511
00:35:31.738 --> 00:35:33.738
And this is the command of the Lord.

512
00:35:33.738 --> 00:35:36.738
In this, He is interested.

513
00:35:37.738 --> 00:35:43.738
For the spiritual also has its aftermath in the psychological natural.

514
00:35:44.738 --> 00:35:48.738
If you walk away from your husband or wife...

515
00:35:48.738 --> 00:35:52.738
you will probably be able to do it again next time.

516
00:35:52.738 --> 00:35:55.738
And this is what God wants to prevent out of His love.

517
00:35:55.738 --> 00:36:00.738
He wants to prevent us from walking from relationship to relationship from brokenness to brokenness.

518
00:36:00.738 --> 00:36:03.738
The lesson that Vanessa just mentioned is the most important.

519
00:36:03.738 --> 00:36:05.738
It must be well with you.

520
00:36:05.738 --> 00:36:08.738
And from your wholeness, you can marry.

521
00:36:08.738 --> 00:36:10.738
Not from your brokenness.

522
00:36:10.738 --> 00:36:14.738
And if you say goodbye to marriage from your brokenness...

523
00:36:14.738 --> 00:36:17.738
while you know you could have handled it differently...

524
00:36:17.738 --> 00:36:19.738
then you should not remarry.

525
00:36:19.738 --> 00:36:24.738
And we have had to give this advice pastorally to several people already.

526
00:36:24.738 --> 00:36:26.738
You cannot remarry.

527
00:36:26.738 --> 00:36:28.738
You should not do it.

528
00:36:28.738 --> 00:36:31.738
Yes, why not? I have the right to happiness, right?

529
00:36:31.738 --> 00:36:33.738
Yes, happiness in Christ.

530
00:36:34.738 --> 00:36:37.738
And here is the next thing I want to say about that.

531
00:36:37.738 --> 00:36:40.738
This situation is so contextual.

532
00:36:40.738 --> 00:36:43.738
That we have been able to give advice to people.

533
00:36:43.738 --> 00:36:45.738
You can remarry.

534
00:36:45.738 --> 00:36:48.738
And other people have been able to say, you cannot remarry.

535
00:36:48.738 --> 00:36:50.738
And the difference lies in this.

536
00:36:50.738 --> 00:36:54.738
At school, and I don't know if this will help you, but this is how I see it.

537
00:36:54.738 --> 00:36:58.738
At school, we had to learn that within this broken world...

538
00:36:58.738 --> 00:37:01.738
you are both a victim of sin...

539
00:37:01.738 --> 00:37:04.738
but also a perpetrator of sin.

540
00:37:04.738 --> 00:37:06.738
I will say it again.

541
00:37:06.738 --> 00:37:11.738
You are both a victim of sin, but also a perpetrator of sin.

542
00:37:11.738 --> 00:37:14.738
Stuff happens to you.

543
00:37:14.738 --> 00:37:17.738
And that shapes the decisions you make in life.

544
00:37:17.738 --> 00:37:22.738
But you can never say to God, yes, I murdered because of that.

545
00:37:22.738 --> 00:37:24.738
Yes, I did this because...

546
00:37:24.738 --> 00:37:29.738
God will hold you accountable for the things you do.

547
00:37:30.738 --> 00:37:36.738
If you know in your life, and now I am speaking in the context of difficult situations...

548
00:37:36.738 --> 00:37:40.738
of the marriages that have broken down in this church.

549
00:37:40.738 --> 00:37:44.738
If you know that you have done everything in your marriage...

550
00:37:44.738 --> 00:37:47.738
to not break this contract.

551
00:37:47.738 --> 00:37:50.738
If you know that you were faithful.

552
00:37:50.738 --> 00:37:53.738
If you know that you have not committed adultery.

553
00:37:53.738 --> 00:37:56.738
If you know that you did not belittle your husband or wife.

554
00:37:56.738 --> 00:38:01.738
If you know that you are not the perpetrator of this divorce.

555
00:38:01.738 --> 00:38:06.738
I believe that God has happiness in mind for you to restore you.

556
00:38:06.738 --> 00:38:09.738
And to see you restored in love again.

557
00:38:09.738 --> 00:38:12.738
This is what I believe with all that is in me.

558
00:38:12.738 --> 00:38:16.738
For based on that, I must also give advice to people who ask for it.

559
00:38:16.738 --> 00:38:21.738
And I have seen it in my life where women were abandoned by their husbands.

560
00:38:21.738 --> 00:38:23.738
Set aside.

561
00:38:23.738 --> 00:38:27.738
And I have seen that my parents were able to give advice to those people there.

562
00:38:27.738 --> 00:38:29.738
You can remarry again.

563
00:38:29.738 --> 00:38:31.738
And those people have remarried and were happy.

564
00:38:31.738 --> 00:38:34.738
And they even bore fruit in their lives.

565
00:38:34.738 --> 00:38:36.738
And they were able to have a happy marriage.

566
00:38:36.738 --> 00:38:39.738
And I know that the Spirit of God is in those marriages.

567
00:38:39.738 --> 00:38:44.738
And that is why I want to indicate that the Word of God is not bam dame basta.

568
00:38:44.738 --> 00:38:47.738
For that is not the nature of Jesus.

569
00:38:47.738 --> 00:38:49.738
He is a good God.

570
00:38:49.738 --> 00:38:54.738
He speaks differently to the woman at the well than to the Pharisee.

571
00:38:54.738 --> 00:38:57.738
Sometimes Jesus is sharp, sometimes He is loving.

572
00:38:57.738 --> 00:39:04.738
Even a woman whom He confronts at the moment when they catch her in the adultery she has committed.

573
00:39:04.738 --> 00:39:08.738
What does Jesus do? He does not bring a sword, He brings restoration.

574
00:39:08.738 --> 00:39:10.738
God is a God of restoration.

575
00:39:10.738 --> 00:39:14.738
But with restoration, and here comes a difficult lesson.

576
00:39:14.738 --> 00:39:22.738
With restoration in view, it is sometimes better for some people not to marry again.

577
00:39:22.738 --> 00:39:28.738
For if you have been in a habit of destroying your relationship.

578
00:39:28.738 --> 00:39:33.738
If you have been so broken and selfish in your life to destroy a marriage.

579
00:39:33.738 --> 00:39:36.738
Then God says, hey listen, I have restoration in mind.

580
00:39:36.738 --> 00:39:38.738
You should not remarry.

581
00:39:38.738 --> 00:39:40.738
Yes but Lord, I am looking for happiness.

582
00:39:40.738 --> 00:39:42.738
Should you be with me? Says the Lord.

583
00:39:43.738 --> 00:39:45.738
Do you understand what I am talking about?

584
00:39:46.738 --> 00:39:48.738
So I do not pronounce any verdicts.

585
00:39:48.738 --> 00:39:50.738
I speak in Jesus' name.

586
00:39:50.738 --> 00:39:54.738
First of all, restoration over your situation in Jesus' name.

587
00:39:54.738 --> 00:39:58.738
And secondly, talk about it.

588
00:39:58.738 --> 00:40:00.738
With the people around you in faith.

589
00:40:00.738 --> 00:40:02.738
Talk about it.

590
00:40:02.738 --> 00:40:04.738
Come talk, I am in pain.

591
00:40:04.738 --> 00:40:07.738
Then you get the advice, have you done this yet?

592
00:40:07.738 --> 00:40:08.738
No, we have not done that yet.

593
00:40:08.738 --> 00:40:10.738
Should you do that first?

594
00:40:10.738 --> 00:40:12.738
Have you not sought professional help yet?

595
00:40:12.738 --> 00:40:14.738
Should you do that first?

596
00:40:14.738 --> 00:40:15.738
Yes, have you done that yet?

597
00:40:15.738 --> 00:40:16.738
No, we have not done that yet.

598
00:40:16.738 --> 00:40:17.738
Have you prayed yet?

599
00:40:17.738 --> 00:40:18.738
We have not done that yet.

600
00:40:18.738 --> 00:40:19.738
Should you do that?

601
00:40:19.738 --> 00:40:20.738
Should you do that?

602
00:40:20.738 --> 00:40:21.738
Should you do that?

603
00:40:21.738 --> 00:40:23.738
And if you have pulled out ten thousand reasons, have you tried that already?

604
00:40:23.738 --> 00:40:24.738
Yes, but he keeps doing this.

605
00:40:24.738 --> 00:40:25.738
She keeps doing that.

606
00:40:25.738 --> 00:40:26.738
And this and that.

607
00:40:26.738 --> 00:40:31.738
When we really talk about abuse, about contempt, abuse, isolation and that kind of

608
00:40:31.738 --> 00:40:36.738
things, ultimately there are indeed situations where divorce is the only possibility

609
00:40:36.738 --> 00:40:37.738
there is.

610
00:40:37.738 --> 00:40:44.738
If you have done everything to stay in Christ with this marriage, but you know

611
00:40:44.738 --> 00:40:49.738
that it would ultimately cost you your own life, then there are indeed situations where that

612
00:40:49.738 --> 00:40:53.738
is the only solution and I know that God is a restoring God.

613
00:40:54.738 --> 00:40:58.738
I hope I can express this in this way about open church in Jesus' name.

614
00:40:58.738 --> 00:40:59.738
Amen.

615
00:40:59.738 --> 00:41:00.738
Thank you.
